{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311880","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311880","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1231188001:1":{"text":"점검이야. 작업반장이 정비사를 불러서 승강기를 점검하고 있어.","source_cn":"是检修，我们工头找了维修师来检修那台升降机。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36A2C58D2B424ED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231188002:1":{"text":"요즘 부두의 일꾼들이 모두 밤낮으로 바쁘거든.","source_cn":"最近整个码头的搬运工都忙的昏天暗地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8265880083BA7237","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231188003:1":{"text":"이럴 때 승강기가 고장 나면 골치가 아플 거야. 그러니 미리 대비하는 게 좋지.","source_cn":"要是升降机在这时候坏了，就麻烦了，所以要防患于未然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE75BF8FBF2FB319","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:码头工人托尔提":{"text":"부두 근로자 토르트","source":"码头工人托尔提","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}